{"id":"pemrograman/javascript/javascript-for-frontend/input-event-menyiapkan-halaman-web","title":"Input Event-Menyiapkan Halaman Web","slug":"input event-menyiapkan halaman web","relativePath":"Pemrograman/JavaScript/Javascript For Frontend/Input Event-Menyiapkan Halaman Web.md","folder":"Pemrograman/JavaScript/Javascript For Frontend","frontmatter":{"tags":[],"aliases":[]},"tags":[],"aliases":[],"headings":[],"content":"#programming \nPada materi sebelumnya, kita telah membahas beberapa event untuk elemen `<form>`. Nah, untuk membuat form yang kaya akan fitur, kita bisa menambahkan event listener untuk setiap elemen input di dalam form. Kita akan mulai dengan event onInput. Setelah itu adalah onFocus, onBlur, onChange, onCopy, dan yang terakhir adalah onPaste.\n\nSesuai dengan kebiasaan kita pada materi-materi sebelumnya, kita akan menyiapkan halaman web baru terlebih dahulu.\n\n```html\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <title>Form World</title>\n\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"contents\">\n      <h2 align=\"center\">Input Event Form</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"formContent\">\n        <form id=\"formDataDiri\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n          <div class=\"form-element\" id=\"fieldName\">\n            <label for=\"inputNama\">Nama Panggilan:</label>\n            <br>\n            <input\n              id=\"inputNama\"\n              type=\"text\"\n              name=\"nama\"\n              placeholder=\"Nama panggilan Anda\"\n              maxlength=\"15\"\n            >\n            <br>\n            <label id=\"notifikasiSisaKarakter\">\n              Sisa karakter: <span id=\"sisaKarakter\"></span>\n            </label>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-element\" id=\"fieldCopy\">\n            <label for=\"inputCopy\"><i>Copy</i> tulisan ini:</label>\n            <br>\n            <input\n              id=\"inputCopy\"\n              type=\"text\"\n              name=\"copy\"\n              value=\"Hello World!\"\n              readonly\n            >\n            <br>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-element\" id=\"fieldPaste\">\n            <label for=\"inputPaste\"><i>Paste</i> tulisan di sini:</label>\n            <br>\n            <input\n              id=\"inputPaste\"\n              type=\"text\"\n              name=\"paste\"\n              placeholder=\"Paste sesuatu di sini\"\n            >\n            <br>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-element\" id=\"fieldCaptcha\">\n            <label for=\"inputCaptcha\">Tulis <i>captcha</i> berikut.</label>\n            <br>\n            <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dicodingacademy/a315-web-pemula-labs/shared-files/captcha.png\" alt=\"Captcha\">\n            <br>\n            <input\n              id=\"inputCaptcha\"\n              type=\"text\"\n              name=\"captcha\"\n              placeholder=\"Tulis captcha di sini\"\n            >\n            <br>\n            <p>\n              Tekan Enter pada keyboard jika sudah selesai menulis\n              <i>captcha</i>\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-element\" align=\"center\">\n            <input\n              id=\"submitButton\"\n              type=\"submit\"\n              value=\"Submit Data\"\n              disabled\n            >\n          </div>\n        </form>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script src=\"index.js\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n```\n\n```css\n.contents {\n  padding: 8px;\n  border: 2px solid black;\n\n  position: fixed;\n  top: 50%;\n  left: 50%;\n\n  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n}\n\n.form-element {\n  margin: 8px;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n#notifikasiSisaKarakter {\n  visibility: hidden;\n}\n```\n\n```js\ndocument.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n  const inputMaxLengthOnLoad = document.getElementById('inputNama').maxLength;\n  document.getElementById('sisaKarakter').innerText = inputMaxLengthOnLoad;\n});\n```\n","excerpt":"#programming  Pada materi sebelumnya, kita telah membahas beberapa event untuk elemen `<form>`. Nah, untuk membuat form yang kaya akan fitur, kita bisa menambahkan event listener untuk setiap elemen input di dalam form. Kita akan mulai deng","readingTime":2,"updated":null,"contentHash":"sha256:950d6400f244554b9f59319523be4cc3a72f3550f6a0309ced9a4faff730994e","outputPath":"Pemrograman/JavaScript/Javascript For Frontend/Input Event-Menyiapkan Halaman Web","breadcrumb":["Pemrograman","JavaScript","Javascript For Frontend"],"links":[],"backlinks":[{"id":"pemrograman/javascript/javascript-for-frontend/03_javascript-for-frontend","title":"03_Javascript For Frontend"}],"brokenLinks":[],"html":"<p>#programming\nPada materi sebelumnya, kita telah membahas beberapa event untuk elemen <code>&#x3C;form></code>. Nah, untuk membuat form yang kaya akan fitur, kita bisa menambahkan event listener untuk setiap elemen input di dalam form. Kita akan mulai dengan event onInput. Setelah itu adalah onFocus, onBlur, onChange, onCopy, dan yang terakhir adalah onPaste.</p>\n<p>Sesuai dengan kebiasaan kita pada materi-materi sebelumnya, kita akan menyiapkan halaman web baru terlebih dahulu.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"hljs language-html\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&#x3C;!DOCTYPE <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">html</span>></span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">html</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">meta</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">charset</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"UTF-8\"</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>></span>Form World<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">title</span>></span>\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">link</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">rel</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"stylesheet\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">href</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"style.css\"</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">head</span>></span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">body</span>></span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"contents\"</span>></span>\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">align</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"center\"</span>></span>Input Event Form<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>></span>\n\n      <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"formContent\"</span>></span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"formDataDiri\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">autocomplete</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"off\"</span>></span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-element\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"fieldName\"</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"inputNama\"</span>></span>Nama Panggilan:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">br</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span>\n              <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"inputNama\"</span>\n              <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"text\"</span>\n              <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"nama\"</span>\n              <span class=\"hljs-attr\">placeholder</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"Nama panggilan Anda\"</span>\n              <span class=\"hljs-attr\">maxlength</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"15\"</span>\n            ></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">br</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"notifikasiSisaKarakter\"</span>></span>\n              Sisa karakter: <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"sisaKarakter\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">span</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>></span>\n\n          <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">class</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"form-element\"</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"fieldCopy\"</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">for</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">\"inputCopy\"</span>></span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span>Copy<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">i</span>></span> tulisan ini:<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">label</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">br</span>></span>\n            <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&#x3C;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span>\n              <span class